{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2931","id":3068287854,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz88624ltu","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2931","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2931.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2931.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2931","number":2931,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"tags: process tags on registration, simplify policy","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR investigates, adds tests and aims to correctly implement Tailscale's model for how Tags should be accepted, assigned and used to identify nodes in the Tailscale access and ownership model. \r\n\r\nWhen evaluating in Headscale's policy, Tags are now only checked against a nodes \"tags\" list, which defines the source of truth for all tags for a given node. This simplifies the code for dealing with tags greatly, and should help us have less access bugs related to nodes belonging to tags or users. \r\n\r\n**A node can _either_ be owned by a user, or a tag**.\r\n\r\nNext, to ensure the tags list on the node is correctly implemented, we first add tests for every registration scenario and combination of user, pre auth key and pre auth key with tags with the same registration expectation as observed by trying them all with the Tailscale control server. This should ensure that we implement the correct behaviour and that it does not change or break over time.\r\n\r\nLastly, the missing parts of the auth has been added, or changed in the cases where it was wrong. This has in large parts allowed us to delete and simplify a lot of code.\r\nNow, tags can _only_ be changed when a node authenticates or if set via the CLI/API. Tags can only be fully overwritten/replaced and any use of either auth or CLI will replace the current set if different.\r\n\r\nA user owned device can be converted to a tagged device, but it cannot be changed back. A tagged device can never remove the last tag either, it has to have a minimum of one.\r\n\r\nChecking all imaginable Tailscale SaaS auth combinations:\r\n<img width=\"1003\" height=\"691\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/052c0de3-5191-4756-a0fe-eee644b46b2d\" />\r\n","created_at":"2025-12-03T17:27:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T17:51:07Z","closed_at":"2025-12-08T17:51:07Z","merged_at":"2025-12-08T17:51:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"22ee2bfc9cad3492c35cf7531c83e190d6ac552b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/sub